[0.380952, "o", "╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\r\n║       Claude Code Go SDK - MCP Integration Demo            ║\r\r\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\r\n\r\r\nThis demo showcases Model Context Protocol (MCP) integration:\r\r\n  • Load MCP server configurations\r\r\n  • Strict mode for isolated MCP environments\r\r\n  • Tool allowlisting for security\r\r\n  • Real-time MCP tool execution visibility\r\r\n\r\r\nð¡ Use /example to set up a demo filesystem MCP server\r\r\n   (Requires: npx and @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem)\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nð MCP Commands:\r\r\n  /config <path>  - Load MCP config from file\r\r\n  /example        - Create and use example MCP config\r\r\n  /strict on|off  - Toggle strict MCP mode\r\r\n  /tools          - Lis"]
[0.38096, "o", "t allowed MCP tools\r\r\n  /al"]
