[0.381098, "o", "/help\r\r\n\r\r\nð MCP Commands:\r\r\n  /config <path>  - Load MCP config from file\r\r\n  /example        - Create and use example MCP config\r\r\n  /strict on|off  - Toggle strict MCP mode\r\r\n  /tools          - List allowed MCP tools\r\r\n  /allow <tool>   - Add tool to allowlist\r\r\n  /clear          - Clear MCP configuration\r\r\n  /status         - Show current MCP status\r\r\n  /help           - Show this help\r\r\n  exit            - Exit the demo\r\r\n\r\r\n>>> "]
